--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 09d9dd0205bab0640872e2256248d999, type: 3}
  m_Name: M1 Battle Tutorial 3 - Ranged Combat
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _source: {fileID: 4900000, guid: ba8d9edc178d35341ac2158926ca1d6a, type: 3}
  _sourcePath: Assets/Leveraged Wars Story/2. Missions/M1-Tutorial/M1 Battle Tutorial
    3 - Ranged Combat.md
  _warnings: []
  _lines:
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Hear that, my prince? Bows.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: 
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Their archers have found us. Are we losing men already?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Some, but that is not what the arrows are for. Most of what archers do
      is frighten.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Every arrow that lands piles on Shock. A troop that marches in under fire
      arrives half broken before the lines even meet.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Do arrows always wound?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: No. Mail and shields turn them. Against men in plain cloth they bleed.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Can I use archers too?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: See the green cone? That is where they can reach. Inside it they shoot
      without being told. Outside it they will not. Order them forward and they will
      walk into range before they loose. CHECK
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Is there a place they cannot shoot?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Too close. They need room, like a swordsman. An enemy on top of them is
      a problem a bow cannot solve, and in melee an archer is no better than a farmer.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Can they shoot over our own men?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Arrows climb and come down. Flat shots do not. Keep your own troops out
      of the line of fire where you can. CHECK
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Javelins run dry, too, so do not waste them.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Then where should they stand?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Behind a line of spears that will hold, or to the side where they have
      a clear view. Keep them away from horsemen. And once the lines meet, turn them
      on something else.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Then I know what to do about theirs. Ride them down.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Quickly, my prince. Archers hate being caught.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
